# Purpose
Explains how to record a decision, its reason, and the options considered.

# Key Sections
- When to use this guide.
- Keep the decision easy to find.
- Start with the decision.
- Include the reason.
- Record the options considered.

# Dependencies
- Belongs to the productivity manual set.

# Gotchas
- Separate the actual decision from recommendations or unapproved options.

